<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets call warrants on UBS. [corrected 12:50 gmt]</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets call warrants on UBS. [corrected 12:50 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company in headline and text from Schweizerische Bankgesellschaft AG)</p>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG, has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Union Bank of Switzerland bearer shares, lead manager Banque Internationale de Placement, Paris said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1350 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.65 CHF		  GEARING	9.9 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.MAY.97-16.OCT.98   PAYDATE	12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1317 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
